<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><img src="https://ppmg--c.na138.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0154V000004uwMJ&amp;oid=00D30000000pfXl&amp;lastMod=1603479721000" alt="Right click on the image to save it to your computer."></div><br><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.4667px;">REI Nation Investors<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px;">Outside Property Management Acquisitions</span><span lang="EN" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 10pt 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: justify;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 17.6333px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"><span lang="EN">For years, you have asked us for our assistance in managing properties not purchased from REI Nation. We are pleased to now extend this offer to you as a current client.&nbsp; If you have properties </span><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 17.6333px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);">in any of the 8 cities we are currently operating in, </span><span lang="EN">Premier Property Management/ PPMG of Texas</span><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 17.6333px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);"> is ready to help! </span><span lang="EN">The properties can be vacant or occupied. We are currently in the following 8 markets, and ready to serve you:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"><span lang="EN">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN">Memphis, TN - St Louis, MO - Dallas, TX -&nbsp; Houston, TX - San Antonio, TX -&nbsp; Oklahoma City, OK - Tulsa, OK -&nbsp; Little Rock, AR<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"><span lang="EN">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"><span lang="EN">If you are interested or know anyone who may need our assistance, please reach out to us and let us know how we can help. For inquiries, please contact:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"><span lang="EN">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 10pt 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 20.7px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);">Davartay Miller</span></b><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 17.6333px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 10pt 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 17.6333px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);">Email: Davartay@reination.com<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 10pt 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 17.6333px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);">Office: 901-505-0931<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 10pt 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 17.6333px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);"><br></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align: left; margin: 10pt 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"><font color="#222222" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><b>{!User.Sig2__c}</b></span></font></p>]]></td>
